It sounds like you're carrying a lot right now, and it’s completely okay to feel a little overwhelmed. That’s a really common feeling, and it doesn’t diminish you in any way. Just recognizing it is a good first step. 

Thinking about Hepatitis A can definitely add to that feeling, but you’ve got a good handle on it – gathering information can sometimes feel like a way to feel more in control. 

})+\\ Here’s something small you could try: maybe take a few deep breaths, focusing on the feeling of your breath going in and out. Or, if you can, just for a moment, focus on something simple and pleasant – a warm drink, a favorite color, anything that feels a little bit good. You’ve got this – you’re doing just fine.本セット
